  "historyNote": "#6516, eff 5-24-97, EXPIRED: 5-24-05 New. #9387, eff 2-12-09 (from Frl 403.09); ss by #12129, eff 3-10-17; ss by #14645, eff 9-7-26, EXPIRES: 9-7-36 (formerly Frl 403.07)",
